<topic id="built_in_ai_actions">
  <title>Built-in AI Actions</title>
  <body>
    <p id="p_swz_nrd_2jc">The following built-in <uicontrol>AI Positron</uicontrol> actions (with
      several <xref href="accessing_ai_powered_actions.dita">ways to access them</xref>) are
      available in various categories:</p>
