    <p id="p_od5_rbx_jbc">
      <note type="note" id="note_pd5_rbx_jbc">Custom actions can be configured in the <xref
          href="actions_preferences.dita">AI Positron Actions preferences page</xref>. Custom
        actions are loaded and shown first in the UI locations where the actions are
        presented.</note>
      <note id="note_jnx_qql_52c" type="tip">You can use the <uicontrol><image
            href="../img/Search16.png"/>Search actions</uicontrol> button at the top of the
          <uicontrol>Actions</uicontrol> drop-down menu to help you quickly locate a particular
        action.</note>
    </p>
